# Port-only (the personal build): the launcher the setup ships in the original's place (MCX.exe beside this file), one
# build release after release so Defender's cloud learns one file once (src/installer/windows/check_launcher.ps1, run
# by the Windows workflow after each build, holds the setup to it). Pin a new build only when the launcher's sources
# change: the check fails then and prints the lines to put here.
#
# sources: git's tree id of src/apps/MCXLauncher; icon: the blob of src/res/MCRedux.ico; built: the commit and the
# fork's Windows run that built it (a work build, without whole-program optimization, as the launcher's project sets).
